+    `amdgpu.buffer_load_to_local` whose offsets are provably non-negative
+    with `amdgpu.split_soffset_safe` (UnitAttr). The LLVM-stage splitter
+    in `BufferOpsEmitter` consults this attribute and only splits when it
+    is present.
